coder › Done on branch `work/redact-secrets` in 3 commits.

What changed:
- Added `src/redact.ts` exporting `redact(value)`: recursively copies objects/arrays; any key whose lowercased name contains `password`, `passwd`, `secret`, `token`, `apikey`, `api_key`, `api-key`, or `authorization` has its value replaced with `'[redacted]'`; any string value has `/Bearer [^\s]+/g` replaced with `'Bearer [redacted]'`; everything else returned unchanged; input never mutated (new objects/arrays built).
- `src/logger.ts`: `log()` now spreads `redact(fields)` instead of `fields`, so output line shape/order (`level`, `message`, fields) is unchanged apart from redaction.
- Added `src/redact.test.ts` (key substrings case-insensitive, deep objects/arrays, Bearer replacement incl. multiples/nested, non-secrets untouched, input not mutated, top-level arrays/strings/primitives) and extended `src/logger.test.ts` (secret redaction, nested + Bearer redaction via `JSON.parse`, fields argument not mutated).

